  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How the hooks run",
      "items": [
        "before_agent and before_model hooks run in list order; after_model hooks in reverse, so HumanInTheLoop (appended last) sees the reply first",
        "wrap_model_call: the first listed is the outermost, so the fallback wraps the retries, which wrap each model's breaker",
        "Each tool round goes back through before_model: PII on the new tool results, then the call limit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "In an outage",
      "items": [
        "An outage is retried once (MODEL_MAX_RETRIES); an open breaker isn't retried, it fails at once",
        "Then ModelFallback calls gpt-4.1 through the same inner stack, under its own breaker",
        "5 outages in 60 s open a model's breaker for 30 s; a user's own endpoint isn't counted"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Approvals",
      "items": [
        "search_knowledge_base never asks; web_search asks only when the query has a sensitive term or an order number",
        "Any other tool always asks, except remember, which isn't in interrupt_on",
        "A paused run resumes from its checkpoint with the reviewer's decision"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Conditional steps",
      "items": [
        "LongTermMemory and the remember tool: MEMORY_ENABLED and a store",
        "PII: PII_ENABLED · context editing: CONTEXT_CLEAR_TOOL_RESULTS_TOKENS > 0 · fallback: FALLBACK_MODEL",
        "SpendTokens: RATE_LIMITS_ENABLED · HumanInTheLoop: HITL_ENABLED · ToolRetry: a retryable tool exists"
      ]
    }
  ]
